# Orca Caudal Viewbox Clear Fluke

In SharkVisuals OrcaBody / SharkCreature, orca viewBox left must start well left of the caudal tip (e.g. -14), never tight pads like 6 or 8 that crop the whale tail. Expand left pad so tip and fluke rotate extremes stay inside; lengthen aft crescent so caudal is clearly attached.

## Verification
- Verified: npm run lint && npm run build passed after expanding viewBox to -14 -18 122 64 and lengthening fluke tip
- Failure pattern avoided: Orca fluke drawn but invisible because viewBox left crop clips aft SVG
- Dead-end ruled out: Assuming SVG overflow:visible fixes cropping — viewBox still discards geometry outside its rect
